# Spark IDE - proven ide show non-PPM fail-loud.
# After show-miss. Show of a .spark path (not P6/.rgb) exits
# non-zero (engine validate format check).
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_show_notppm.spark  (expect rc!=0)
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven fail-loud only.

ide open "examples/hello.spark"

ide show "examples/hello.spark"
